  "notes": "Trey introduced Dog Log with \"There's enough of those damn signs out there.\" Dog Log was last played on August 2, 2003 (172 shows). Hood was unfinished. Prior to Sleeping Monkey, Trey teased the\u00a0<em>Star Wars</em>\u00a0theme and said \"Fish, when you get to the end of this beautiful song, one last time for all of us. One final tuck.\" Trey added that \"it's been a beautiful two days, but it wouldn't be complete without seeing Fish\u00a0tuck his dress into his underwear one last time\" and \"I'm singing this one right to you Fish, because I am your father.\" Trey proceeded to sing to Fish using Mike's mic. Tweezer Reprise contained Sleeping Monkey quotes from Fish.",
